# Issue hygiene

Write every new or fixed bug to [docs/ISSUES-AND-FIXES.md](docs/ISSUES-AND-FIXES.md). Search first. New items take the next `FH-XXX`. Never reuse ids.

A fix is not done until that file has **Do / Do NOT / Files / Verify**. Chat is not the log.
